# Build/serving-critical small binaries MUST stay as real git content.
# LFS pointers break GitHub Actions builds (GradleWrapperMain ClassNotFound)
# and Base44's git-based web deploys (broken icons). Added Sep 16 2026 after
# the broad *.jar/*.png LFS rules converted these to pointers.
capacitor/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar !filter !diff !merge binary
public/apple-touch-icon.png !filter !diff !merge binary
public/favicon-32.png !filter !diff !merge binary
public/icons/icon-192-v2.png !filter !diff !merge binary
public/icons/icon-512-v2.png !filter !diff !merge binary
